OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will stay dry for all parts
OL,6,Fthroughout the day with variable and
OL,7,Fpatchy cloud allowing long spells of
OL,8,Fsunshine to break through. Winds
OL,9,Fremaining light throughout.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and settled night with
OL,12,Fmostly cloudy skies, though some clear
OL,13,Fintervals are still possible. Winds
OL,14,Fwill strengthen overnight, especially
OL,15,Faround the coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
