OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FDry and mostly cloudy start
OL,6,Fwith some brightness. Cloud soon
OL,7,Flowering and thickeningwith some light
OL,8,Frain possible through the afternoon.
OL,9,FWinds strengthening further with gales
OL,10,Fpossible near coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FStrong
OL,13,Fwinds Wednesday with rain clearing
OL,14,Feast to leave sunny spells and
OL,15,Fshowers. Mostly dry with sunny spells
OL,16,FThursday and winds easing. Cloudy
OL,17,FFriday with rain spreading east.
